Email + password signup and login, plus the upgrade path that turns a device-only account into a real one WITHOUT losing its summaries.

CREATE `src/lib/server/pw.ts` — PBKDF2 via WebCrypto (Workers has no bcrypt/argon; PBKDF2-SHA256 at 100k iterations is the right call here):
```ts
export async function hash_pw(pw: string): Promise<string> {
	const salt = crypto.getRandomValues(new Uint8Array(16));
	const bits = await derive(pw, salt);
	return `${hex(salt)}$${hex(new Uint8Array(bits))}`;
}
export async function verify_pw(pw: string, stored: string): Promise<boolean> {
	const [s, h] = stored.split('$');
	if (!s || !h) return false;
	return hex(new Uint8Array(await derive(pw, unhex(s)))) === h;
}
```
with `derive` = `crypto.subtle.deriveBits({ name: 'PBKDF2', salt, iterations: 100_000, hash: 'SHA-256' }, imported_key, 256)`.

